{"identity_key": "bilibili:1271964726613508119", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1271964726613508119", "content": "【来自 #Key社# 成员的本周“水贴”】 \n「2026年11月18日 · #高梨泰辅# 」 \n\n大家好，这里是负责音乐的高梨。\n昨天，我再次认识到“团队合作”的重要性。\n在和ゆう⑨一起吃炸鸡定食（盒饭）的时候，我隐约把一块炸鸡看成了泰迪犬了，我想今天就在blog中画出来。\n借了数位板，画了炸鸡块，很糟糕啊……。\n除了音乐啥不行的我是没法一个人做游戏的。需要和各路人马合作，才能做出想做出来的好游戏！ \n\n翻译：@林檎果officialCN  \n\nhttps://x.com/key_official/status/2122966143199584453", "publisher": "StuartRiki_鍵視", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1271964726613508119", "published_at": "2026-11-18T08:32:46+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T15:28:02.894456+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/8e1512cfaded198ae8afc9b4d856bdf139471072.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_39471072", "uid": "39471072", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 115, "retweets": 0, "replies": 0}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1271967380907491328", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1271967380907491328", "content": "我们将出展Weplay 2026\n继去年我们首次携《魔法少女的魔女审判》出展Weplay，并且得到了很多玩家的支持后，今年我们将再次来到上海与大家见面！\n\n我们的展位是在B09，现场将会提供《魔法少女的魔女审判》Nintendo Switch版，《我推的祭品》、《D.M.L.C.！欢闹炸恋生死斗》、《VTuber’s Game : Ctrl+Alt+Del》等游戏的试玩。此外本次不设销售区域。\n\n只要关注我们官方社区账号（小黑盒、小红书、微博、bilibili）任何两个或现场试玩，即可获得两款A4纪念文件夹（魔法少女的魔女审判+我推的祭品），每天数量有限，送完即止。\n\n特别介绍\n\n本次展会上，我们将会首次展出《VTuber’s Game : Ctrl+Alt+Del》（中文名待定）的试玩，这是一款直播屏幕型的“方块游戏风格×塔防×养成合成”的冒险游戏。\n\n本游戏的目的是接近杀害了你最喜欢的偶像并冒充她继续活动的“冒牌VTuber”——冒牌的“天埜玛丽亚”。主人公选择成为一个知名VTuber，在达到和她相同的水平后，邀请她线下合作并展开复仇。\n\nVTuber制作公司“SUIT”里有13个人气顶尖的VTuber主播。\n\n犯人就在她们之中。\n\n📅活动时间\n\n11月21日-22日\n\n📍地点\n\n上海国家会展中心2.2馆 B09", "publisher": "CircleLineGames", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1271967380907491328", "published_at": "2026-11-18T08:43:04+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T15:28:02.894456+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/dfe245e9927bafdf48bb14507bd8834a3546777970018899.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/b00cd8aa5a6811360b368e7c223a2f623546777970018899.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/03ebe44be201fc1eb1c7c474294fb88e3546777970018899.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/e7e1eebf501b3f9d1830e379be7c4c693546777970018899.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/54aad80e6db7290af0e41978b036771c3546777970018899.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/2b5472aa1f1952cf8501b3468db218053546777970018899.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/90029d9ccbb75b7dfea41d2d9e3ebcfa3546777970018899.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3546777970018899", "uid": "3546777970018899", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "我们将出展Weplay 2026", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 235, "retweets": 1, "replies