{"identity_key": "bilibili:1271987208646033429", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1271987208646033429", "content": "《突然＊恋人》全高清合集版现正于Steam促销热卖中！仅需46元即可入手！\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/2510810\n\n本作拥有1920X1080的高画质，同时收录游戏本篇与两部后日谈《突然＊恋人 超甜蜜After Story》内容，支持多达50个Steam成就、集换卡牌与云存储等功能，并支持大量额外内容。\n\n《突然＊恋人》（Making＊Lovers）系列是由日本知名美少女游戏品牌SMEE为纪念品牌成立十周年所制作的恋爱AVG作品。本作拥有「自拟约会系统」、「在不同女主角路线生活工作场景各有不同」、「自定男主角姓名和头像」等特色，整体基调也保持了SMEE旗下作品一贯的高甜度。《突然＊恋人》曾荣获萌系游戏大赏年度准大奖、主题歌金奖和年度排名第5的殊荣。并在美少女游戏大赏中获得了综合第3、系统第8、音乐第5、视频第8和角色第2（北大路可怜）多个奖项。\n\n#HIKARIFIELD# #GALGAME# #GAL# #游戏# #STEAM游戏# #STEAM#  #视觉小说类游戏# #视觉小说#", "publisher": "HIKARI-FIELD", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1271987208646033429", "published_at": "2026-11-18T10:00:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T15:28:02.894456+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/78f92092acf031a2230111d336a3ab6a41883712.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_41883712", "uid": "41883712", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 180, "retweets": 0, "replies": 2}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1271987208657567763", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1271987208657567763", "content": "【地球上究竟有多少？Hive的数量👀】\n在《Muv-Luv Alternative》的世界中，截至2000年，欧亚大陆与日本列岛已存在多达26座Hive。\n另一方面，美国与澳大利亚未受BETA威胁，因此成为了人类主要的粮食供应地。", "publisher": "Muv-Luv官方", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1271987208657567763", "published_at": "2026-11-18T10:00:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T15:28:02.894456+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/b798fe4e91c5aa59f7e148acb4221c2c3546900143802616.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3546900143802616", "uid": "3546900143802616", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "【地球上究竟有多少？Hive的数量👀】", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 25, "retweets": 1, "replies": 1}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
